  "prefLabel": "Env-A 1203.35 Metal to urethane/rubber molding or casting adhesive",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 1203.35 “Metal to urethane/rubber molding or casting adhesive” means any adhesive intended by the manufacturer to bond metal to high density or elastomeric urethane or molded rubber materials, in heater molding or casting processes, to fabricate products such as rollers for computer printers or other paper handling equipment.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-A 1200) #9933, eff 6-1-11; ss by #12899, eff 10-17-19",
